## 1. Declarative Statements and Execution Model

Commands and queries in {{TOOL_DISPLAY_NAME}} follow declarative specifications executed against physical compute engines:
- **Statement Structure:** High-level clauses must follow canonical keyword ordering.
- **Identifier Scoping:** Attribute names must resolve against explicit tables or aliases to prevent ambiguous bindings.
