## 2. Supported Operators and Expressions

| Category | Operators / Functions | Usage Guidance |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Comparison** | `=`, `!=`, `<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=` | Sargable comparisons against indexed or partitioned attributes |
| **Logical** | `AND`, `OR`, `NOT` | Parenthesize compound boolean expressions to ensure deterministic precedence |
| **Nullability** | `IS NULL`, `IS NOT NULL`, `COALESCE` | Explicit null handling across nullable attributes |
| **Arithmetic** | `+`, `-`, `*`, `/` | Use safe arithmetic operators to prevent division-by-zero crashes |

